{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738440/extras/V8SOjm.gif?t=1759333188\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakout Season is a chaotic, ball-bouncing roguelike set in a colorful world of juicy blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim carefully to blast through the block-filled levels, and shoot your way across all four seasons, each bringing new challenges and increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending the unpredictable thrill of physics-driven ricochets with strategic planning and clever decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a unique team of blocks, collect powerful, game-changing tools, and turn the chaos in your favor to rack up sky-high points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings fresh opportunities to experiment with new builds, wild synergies, and various playstyles.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738440?t=1759333188","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738440?t=1759333188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738440/327ef19a97c0b0c4c21014dec52f24675f5c6e2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759333188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738440/327ef19a97c0b0c4c21014dec52f24675f5c6e2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759333188","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Demo notes</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello and thanks for checking out our <strong>demo</strong>! This version of <strong>Breakout Season</strong>\u00a0features a restricted amount of unlockable items, characters and blocks compared to the full game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're hard at work expanding the full game with even more content, and we'd love to hear your feedback, ideas, or wild suggestions. If you like what you see, please add <strong>Breakout Season\u00a0</strong>to your <strong>wishlist</strong> and spread the word. Your support means a lot! </p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738440/extras/V8SOjm.gif?t=1759333188\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakout Season is a chaotic, ball-bouncing roguelike set in a colorful world of juicy blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim carefully to blast through the block-filled levels, and shoot your way across all four seasons, each bringing new challenges and increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending the unpredictable thrill of physics-driven ricochets with strategic planning and clever decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a unique team of blocks, collect powerful, game-changing tools, and turn the chaos in your favor to rack up sky-high points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings fresh opportunities to experiment with new builds, wild synergies, and various playstyles.</p>","developers":["Kakaos Collective"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3682370","name":"Breakout Season"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738440/b4bdc434beffe5bc215ee6998a57defcb35c8103/header.jpg?t=1759333188","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3738440/212120068/e2ce68a72601e095bc408c8073c8efcce0f33f77/1751306336/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759333186",